mask to wearing shoes.

00:06:12.572 --> 00:06:14.741 align:start size:88% position:13%
"You don't think wearing
shoes is restrictive.

00:06:14.741 --> 00:06:17.677
It's more restrictive
than wearing a mask."

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:21.848
Just insane middle-aged
cows setting policy.

00:06:21.848 --> 00:06:25.785
So yes, for a guy like me,

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:27.620
I would like somebody

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.623
with some experience
in the private sector,

00:06:30.623 --> 00:06:33.860 align:start size:88% position:13%
making normal decisions
for the citizens.

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:37.864
- It's like being in a city run
by the ladies of "The View".

00:06:37.864 --> 00:06:39.432 align:start size:97% position:3%
I really don't know how
you do it anyway, honestly.

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:40.366
- Yes.

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:42.201
- That's what you're up against.

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:44.070
- That's exactly what it is.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.505
That's exactly what it is.

00:06:45.505 --> 00:06:50.510 align:start size:81% position:19%
It's just a insane
cadre of yentas

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:56.382
who have feelings about
wearing masks and have,

00:06:56.382 --> 00:06:58.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's like Rochelle
Walensky, head of the CDC,

00:06:58.851 --> 00:06:59.852
when she was up there like,

00:06:59.852 --> 00:07:01.954
"I'm speaking as a mother.

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:03.556
I have a bad feeling."

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:06.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one gives a shit about
