00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:24.410 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I feel like you
just gave Ben Shapiro

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:25.845
a great idea for his next book,

00:07:25.845 --> 00:07:28.581
"No One Gives a About
Your Feelings Witch".

00:07:28.581 --> 00:07:30.283 align:start size:75% position:25%
That feels like-
- Yes.

00:07:30.283 --> 00:07:32.885
- You could co-write
that with him, I think.

00:07:32.885 --> 00:07:33.719
- I'd love it.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:37.323
- So I believe, because
I do do my research,

00:07:37.323 --> 00:07:39.559
although I said I'm gonna
