00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:44.297 align:start size:84% position:16%
and then you're gonna
get the hell out.

00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:45.998
Is that really the plan?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.501
- Oh yeah.

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:51.304 align:start size:84% position:16%
You have to, you
can't run a business

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:56.309
