00:07:57.743 --> 00:08:01.781 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, I guess you could
work for the TSA, I imagine,

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:02.949
and stay in California,

00:08:02.949 --> 00:08:05.184
but you can't practically do it

00:08:05.184 --> 00:08:07.720
if you're trying
to run a business.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.555
So yes, I would have to leave.

00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:13.659 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Speaking of the
craziness of the world,

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:15.161 align:start size:81% position:19%
