in a recession.

00:08:17.129 --> 00:08:21.367
As of this morning, on July
28th, we are in a recession.

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:24.237
Although they have thus changed

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:26.372 align:start size:84% position:16%
