yeah, we've been to the border."

00:09:12.351 --> 00:09:13.786
"You've been to the border?"

00:09:13.786 --> 00:09:15.254
"We have."

00:09:15.254 --> 00:09:18.024
And then he goes, "But have
you been to the border?"

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:20.960 align:start size:88% position:13%
And she's like, "I
haven't been to Europe.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.495
