00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:30.870
it's her at the end she goes,

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.572 align:start size:81% position:19%
"I don't know what
you're asking."

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:38.878 align:start position:0%
