asking, you're the Border Czar."

00:09:38.878 --> 00:09:42.181 align:start position:0%
Let's just say you're the
queen of the Mardi Gras parade.

00:09:42.181 --> 00:09:45.651
And I said, "Have you
been to Mardi Gras?"

00:09:45.651 --> 00:09:47.353
