down and what is a recession?

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:03.603
What's a border, I don't know.

00:10:03.603 --> 00:10:05.938
It's all invisible,
we can't define it.

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:06.806
What's a woman?

00:10:06.806 --> 00:10:08.441 align:start size:75% position:25%
I can't.
