00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:09.642
- So it's not definable?

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:10.943
So how are we gonna...

00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:12.612
I mean, it's like you go in,

00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:14.513 align:start size:97% position:3%
