00:10:33.332 --> 00:10:37.203
And it, by the way you dodged
a bullet 'cause you're gay.

00:10:37.203 --> 00:10:40.673 align:start size:97% position:3%
But when you argue with
women, that's how you argue.

00:10:40.673 --> 00:10:42.274
You start to talk about things-

00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:43.776
- That's terrible.

00:10:43.776 --> 00:10:46.579
- You don't even know what
you're talking about anymore.

00:10:46.579 --> 00:10:49.482
And that's kind of
the new world order.

